  "_readme": "Every spec is an object: value (in the unit listed under 'fields'), source (an id from 'sources'), status ('verified' = matches the source; 'unverified' = could not be confirmed, check it yourself), and an optional note. The app reads labels and units from 'fields', so adding a field here does not require changing the table code.",

